1. A valid VC5 header "VC-%" (0x56432d35)
2. Tags to set up the image (ChannelCount, ImageWidth, ImageHeight, etc.)
3. A `SubbandNumber` tag with a non-zero value (so we take the HighPassBand path)
4. A `LargeCodeblock` chunk WITHOUT a preceding `Quantization` tag

